// CommunityTopics / Replies (summary):
// - Create with status Pending (hidden=true) or Approved (hidden=false).
// - Authors cannot change status/hidden (Manager/admin only).
// - Author/admin may physically delete a topic when replyCount == 0.
// - Author/admin may physically delete a reply when replicaCount == 0.
// - Signed-in clients may onlyChanged(['replyCount']) on topics and
//   onlyChanged(['replicaCount']) on replies (create/delete counters).
